{"name":"Snapdragon","hex":"#fed777","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"snapdragon","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any plant of the genus Antirrhinum, with showy yellow, white or red flowers.","A game in which raisins are snatched from a vessel containing burning brandy, and eaten; the substance snatched and eaten during the playing of the game; the vessel used for the game."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/snapdragon"}],"entries":[{"title":"Snapdragon (graphic novel)","blocks":[{"text":"Snapdragon is a graphic novel written and illustrated by Kat Leyh, which was published in 2020 by First Second Books. It tells the story of a teenage girl called Snapdragon, who becomes friends with the neighborhood witch, and focuses on her life and relationships."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/00/Snapdragon_%28graphic_novel%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Snapdragon_(graphic_novel)"},{"title":"Snapdragon (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Snapdragon is a 1993 film directed by Worth Keeter. It stars Pamela Anderson and was her first starring film role after the success of her Playboy layouts."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b4/SnapdragonDVD.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Snapdragon_(film)"},{"title":"Antirrhinum","blocks":[{"text":"Antirrhinum is a genus of plants in the Plantaginaceae family, commonly known as dragon flowers or snapdragons because of the flowers' fancied resemblance to the face of a dragon that opens and closes its mouth when laterally squeezed. They are also sometimes called toadflax or dog flower. They are native to rocky areas of Europe, the United States, Canada, and North Africa. Antirrhinum species are widely used as ornamental plants in borders and as cut flowers."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6f/Antirrhinum_majus_BCBG_%2802%29.jpg/330px-Antirrhinum_majus_BCBG_%2802%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antirrhinum"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/Yellow-Snapdragon-Flower%28Antirrhinum_majus%29_08.jpg/120px-Yellow-Snapdragon-Flower%28Antirrhinum_majus%29_08.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/Yellow-Snapdragon-Flower%28Antirrhinum_majus%29_08.jpg/250px-Yellow-Snapdragon-Flower%28Antirrhinum_majus%29_08.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/Yellow-Snapdragon-Flower%28Antirrhinum_majus%29_08.jpg/120px-Yellow-Snapdragon-Flower%28Antirrhinum_majus%29_08.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AYellow-Snapdragon-Flower(Antirrhinum_majus)_08.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Antirrhinum_majus-Flower_01.jpg/120px-Antirrhinum_majus-Flower_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Antirrhinum_majus-Flower_01.jpg/250px-Antirrhinum_majus-Flower_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Antirrhinum_majus-Flower_01.jpg/120px-Antirrhinum_majus-Flower_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAntirrhinum_majus-Flower_01.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Pink_Snapdragon_Flower-Antirrhinum_majus_02.jpg/120px-Pink_Snapdragon_Flower-Antirrhinum_majus_02.jpg?utm_sour